# Private sample manuscripts are authorized for AI7 use only while they
# remain private and local (ADR 0016). They must never be committed, in
# history or working tree. This design room is Markdown-only, so document
# formats are excluded outright rather than by path.
SampleBooks/
*.doc
*.docx
*.pdf
*.odt
*.rtf

# Local secrets and credential material never enter the repository.
.env
*.key
*.pem
